{"title": "Flask of Light", "pageid": 31214, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Flask_of_Light", "categories": ["Books", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Tome_S_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Book_Tome_S_Image.png/300px-Book_Tome_S_Image.png.webp, /w/images/3/33/Book_Tome_S_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Flask of Light image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Book_Tome_S_Image.png/300px-Book_Tome_S_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/33/Book_Tome_S_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Flask of Light</b> is a recipe book potentially written by <a href=\"/wiki/Haskinn_Xhesilaphin\" title=\"Haskinn Xhesilaphin\">Haskinn Xhesilaphin</a>. The copy in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Velveteen_Elixir\" title=\"The Velveteen Elixir\">The Velveteen Elixir</a> has a note written by <a href=\"/wiki/Yrre\" title=\"Yrre\">Yrre</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Lenore_De_Hurst\" title=\"Lenore De Hurst\">Lenore De Hurst</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This book is redolent with the enticing smell of paper and ink.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/38px-Books_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/50px-Books_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Books\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Books_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\">Books</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author:  Haskinn Xhesilaphin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haskinn_Xhesilaphin\" title=\"Haskinn Xhesilaphin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/25px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/38px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/50px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haskinn Xhesilaphin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/25px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haskinn_Xhesilaphin\" title=\"Haskinn Xhesilaphin\">Haskinn Xhesilaphin</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-bd4f54a76169f9eaEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-1336c9af21da1d74END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_Alchemy_LightFlask</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_Alchemy_LightFlask\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_Alchemy_LightFlask\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">b7b4f043-cb61-4e02-86e1-33845af4bc46</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b7b4f043-cb61-4e02-86e1-33845af4bc46\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b7b4f043-cb61-4e02-86e1-33845af4bc46\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Velveteen_Elixir\" title=\"The Velveteen Elixir\">The Velveteen Elixir</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-21&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;129</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Today in the <a href=\"/wiki/Elfsong_Tavern\" title=\"Elfsong Tavern\">Elfsong</a>, Nikros sat down across from me bold as you like. I gave him this recipe, just to see that smile of his. His face lit up, eyes twinkling, but that soothing feeling I'd hoped for didn't come. My skin just prickled painfully, as it always does.\n</p><p><br>\nRECIPE for 1 Flask of Light\n</p><p><br>\nExtracts Needed:\n</p><p>- <a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Nightlight\" title=\"Essence of Nightlight\">Essence of Nightlight</a>\n</p><p>- <a href=\"/wiki/Suspension_of_Laculite\" title=\"Suspension of Laculite\">Suspension of Laculite</a>.\n</p><p><br>\nMethod:\n</p><p>Sieve the Nightlight into the Laculite. Stir with a copper stylus. Exert patience (presuming you were born with a ready supply), and lo, the solution will begin to glow with a bright and dancing light.\n</p><p><br>\nAs always:\n</p><p>When in doubt with alchemy\n</p><p>Just recall the <a href=\"/wiki/Extracts_-_The_Rule_of_Three\" title=\"Extracts - The Rule of Three\">rule of three</a>\n</p><p>Thrice the same ingredient\n</p><p>Forms an extract excellent\n</p><p><br>\nFunny. Writing that helpful little rhyme made my jaw clench tight.\n</p><p>It hurt.\n</p><p><br>\n[A small annotation on this copy reads: '<a href=\"/wiki/Lenore\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lenore\">Lenore</a>, found this recipe and (surprise, surprise) you leapt into my head. Hope you find a little light among the shadows. I'm sure you will, though none as bright as you. - Yrre']\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715060403\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1612/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34012/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11178/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936215/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.863      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.863      1 -total\n 53.69%   24.088      7 Template:Icon_text\n 46.77%   20.983     17 Template:Trim\n 21.79%    9.777      2 Template:Uid\n 17.25%    7.737      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.02%    5.841      2 Template:Icon_link\n 12.49%    5.605      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.55%    4.731      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.43%    4.679      1 Template:Books\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31214-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715060403 and revision id 297030. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}